  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Ported GetShortJobInfo, GetFullJobInfo, MinimizeStaadMainWindow, MaximizeStaadMainWindow and RestoreStaadMainWindow with complete matching XML IntelliSense. Added editable job snapshots with strict native output and culture-aware date validation. Window requests validate live handles and process ownership before asynchronous state requests. Reused binding, thread and non-reentrancy guards. Twenty-five Root operations are implemented; see the job information/window guide for contracts and native qualification limits.",
